  m_Name: Enemy #098
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_name: The castaway
  m_entryIndex: 98
  m_description: 'Thin, scarred, and covered in ropes and hooks, the Castaway is
    believed to be what remains of someone who survived alone for far too long. Its
    wooden ship-mask hides its face, while a harpoon allows it to pull victims toward
    it.


    It has poor vision at a distance and becomes vulnerable when its harpoon
    is trapped. Fire can also force it from hiding. Damaging its mask, however, sends
    it into a violent frenzy.'
  m_threatLevel: 2
